 Intro
 ~~~~~
 Friend could be one of the weirdest programs you have ever seen, it is
basically a listener kind of chat thingie, whatever ... This is the first
version of the program, iow, v0.5 . Hey, all you have to do is let someone
talk to him/herself for a while here, let them think you are not available,
then all would be cool, just watch them talk to themselves .


 Installation
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Just copy the Friend.dd file to your DOORS: directory edit the config file
to make it accept the Rexx door, something like this ( I use MUI )

Execute CMD : Doors:Rexx %N Doors:Friend.dd
and the rest I can't rememeber .

 If you face any problems just email me ....


 How To Use the Program
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Using this program is very easy, just install it and turn on the sysop away
button on the server, when the user realises that you are away he could mess
around, see if he/she chooses the Friend door, if they do just watch them
talk to themselves, hahahah !! I've tested it, it works splendid !!


